@startuml uc_04_faults
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title F4 Handle faults (REQ-13, REQ-14)
start
:Detect fault; log cause;\nShow catalogue context and counted red code;
if (Wi-Fi-only fault?) then (yes)
 :Preserve working audio; permit offline Start;\nRun selected retry/setup/offline recovery;
else (no)
 :Halt active workflow; mute/cancel audio; block Start;
 if (Catalogue requires restart?) then (yes)
  :Restart; run startup checks;
 else (no)
  :Short press acknowledges; return to Idle;
 endif
endif
stop
floating note
 Acknowledgement never starts listening or manually retries setup.
 Wi-Fi setup retry: 2 s hold in Idle; automatic recovery remains automatic.
 Wi-Fi save failure retains connection with unsaved credentials.
end note
@enduml
